---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="FAQ — AASRA" description="Frequently asked questions.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:640px;">
      <h1>FAQ</h1>
      <details>
        <summary>Do you accept Cash on Delivery?</summary>
        <p>No. We do not offer Cash on Delivery. Pay in full online, or pay a deposit and the balance online before shipping.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>How does deposit payment work?</summary>
        <p>On eligible products, you can pay a deposit (30%) at checkout and the remaining balance online before your order ships. The balance link is sent by email.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>How long does delivery take?</summary>
        <p>Dispatch within 2 business days of payment confirmation; delivery 2–7 days by city.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Can I return an item?</summary>
        <p>Returns accepted within 7 days of delivery, unused and in original packaging. See our Return &amp; Refund Policy.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Is my payment secure?</summary>
        <p>Yes. Payments are processed on a secure hosted gateway. Card data never touches our servers.</p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
